As I wrote yesterday, a lot of really interesting posts popped up all of a sudden and I speculated that I might have to break my rule about <a href="https://irreal.org/blog/?p=13646">not covering items that Sacha has already mentioned</a>. I&rsquo;m giving myself leave to mention at least one more post from last week.
